# The pixels a hello screenshot is checked against: 640x400 CSS px at
# 1x, as the native window and the page-contract browser draw it. The
# panel is laid out at x 76..564, y 120..280.
# `pixel X Y #rrggbb` is exact within 1 per channel; `ink X0 Y0 X1 Y1
# #rrggbb` needs at least one pixel in the box that is not that colour.
pixel 4 4 #e9ecef          page, top left
pixel 636 396 #e9ecef      page, bottom right
pixel 75 200 #e9ecef       page, just left of the panel
pixel 76 200 #171b1f       panel, its left column
pixel 84 128 #171b1f       panel padding, top left
pixel 563 279 #171b1f      panel, its bottom-right pixel
pixel 564 279 #e9ecef      page, just right of the panel
pixel 320 257 #3a7bd5      the note bar under the paragraph
ink 100 140 540 240 #171b1f the heading and paragraph are drawn
